<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net sellers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of January 20 to January 24, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   541.97 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  604.47 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net selling			 62.50 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net selling	7.66 billion yen</p>
</text>
